  "data": {
    "ruleType": "detachment-rule",
    "group": "Inner Circle Task Force",
    "summary": "As your Movement phase starts, choose one option; its **Vowed objectives** last until your next Movement phase starts:\n\n- **Defensive Footing**: one objective you control becomes your **Vowed objective**.\n- **Aggressive Push**: one or more objectives you do not control each become a **Vowed objective** of yours; any rule about being in range of the **Vowed objective** then applies when a unit or model is in range of at least one of them.\n\nAttacks by your **DEATHWING INFANTRY** units against a unit in range of any of your **Vowed objectives** get +1 to **Wound rolls**.",
